OL,3,GNEWSA'Fly-tippers dump anywhere and we
OL,4,Astruggle to cope'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFly-tipping has become so prevalent
OL,7,Fthat a Worcestershire waste removal
OL,8,Fbusiness says it is struggling to keep
OL,9,Fup with the number of call-outs.
OL,11,FSteve Hempstock, owner of Steve's
OL,12,FRubbish Removals in Worcester, said he
OL,13,Fwas now being asked to clear illegally
OL,14,Fdumped waste "two or three times" a
OL,15,Fweek and believed the problem had
OL,16,Fworsened over the last couple of years.
OL,18,F"We're struggling to cope with it, to
OL,19,Fbe honest," he said, adding: "People
OL,20,Fare just tipping it anywhere."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
