OL,3,GNEWSA'Fly-tippers dump anywhere and we
OL,4,Astruggle to cope'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe business owner said fly-tippers
OL,7,Fwere targeting industrial estates,
OL,8,Fprivate land and rural locations,
OL,9,Fleaving behind everything from
OL,10,Fhousehold waste and rubble, to
OL,11,Fhazardous materials including asbestos
OL,12,Fand needles.
